{"2656050":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Knytt Classic","steam_appid":2656050,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/70835424567877241d6919958d1bf76a.poster.avif?t=1794515289\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/70835424567877241d6919958d1bf76a.webm?t=1794515289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/70835424567877241d6919958d1bf76a.mp4?t=1794515289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The indie freeware classic returns! It's been 20 years since visionary Swedish indie developer <strong>Nifflas <\/strong>(<i>Rhythm Doggo<\/i>, <i>Ynglet<\/i>) released <strong><i>Knytt, <\/i><\/strong>the first title in the atmospheric platforming series<strong><i>.<\/i><\/strong> Made with the help of a passionate group of internet forum collaborators, the game was released for free on the web in 2006, and later followed up by <i>Knytt Stories<\/i> (2007) and <i>Knytt Underground<\/i> (2012). <i>IGN<\/i> called <i>Knytt<\/i> &quot;an extremely soothing and memorable ambient adventure&quot;, while <i>Edge Magazine<\/i> remarked it was &quot;pure platforming pleasure and a wonderfully soothing soundscape.&quot;<i> <\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help celebrate the 20th anniversary, <strong>Bit Kid<\/strong> (<i>Chasm<\/i>, <i>WOLFHOUND<\/i>) is proud to present <i><strong>Knytt Classic<\/strong><\/i>, a free pixel-perfect port with full controller support, achievements, bonus modes, display effects, and much more!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/ecd76e78522d714b34856632e0b056c8.poster.avif?t=1794515289\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/ecd76e78522d714b34856632e0b056c8.webm?t=1794515289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/ecd76e78522d714b34856632e0b056c8.mp4?t=1794515289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the Knytt, a peaceful being who is abducted by aliens for a cruise across the solar system and ends up crash-landing on another world. Explore the atmospheric, maze-like planet and collect all the parts from your crashed ship in order to return home. As <i>Edge<\/i> put it, &quot;There’s no combat, no switches, and no real puzzles to speak of, just plentiful checkpoints, pure platforming pleasure and a wonderfully soothing soundscape.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/46e0a11739a30a921ce0c7302459a5c3.poster.avif?t=1794515289\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/46e0a11739a30a921ce0c7302459a5c3.webm?t=1794515289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/46e0a11739a30a921ce0c7302459a5c3.mp4?t=1794515289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pixel-perfect port of Nifflas' indie freeware classic <i>Knytt<\/i> (2006)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1,500 screens to explore across the original game and three bonus modes<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus Modes include <i><strong>UltraTough<\/strong>, <\/i>a brand new challenging mode by Bit Kid, <strong>Hempuli<\/strong>’s (<i>Baba Is You, Environment Station Alpha<\/i>) mod <strong>Knytt XH (<i>Extra Hard)<\/i><\/strong>, and <strong><i>Brutally Unfair Knytt<\/i><\/strong>’s remixed world<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements &amp; hidden bonuses<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full gamepad support and remappable controls<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple aspect ratios &amp; display effects, including retro CRT and handheld LCD styles<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional in-game timer and fastest completion time tracking<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows, Mac, Linux &amp; Steam Deck support<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/6e3cc0d21b8cba1d34b3bd400e86596a.poster.avif?t=1794515289\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/6e3cc0d21b8cba1d34b3bd400e86596a.webm?t=1794515289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/6e3cc0d21b8cba1d34b3bd400e86596a.mp4?t=1794515289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/70835424567877241d6919958d1bf76a.poster.avif?t=1794515289\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/70835424567877241d6919958d1bf76a.webm?t=1794515289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/70835424567877241d6919958d1bf76a.mp4?t=1794515289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The indie freeware classic returns! It's been 20 years since visionary Swedish indie developer <strong>Nifflas <\/strong>(<i>Rhythm Doggo<\/i>, <i>Ynglet<\/i>) released <strong><i>Knytt, <\/i><\/strong>the first title in the atmospheric platforming series<strong><i>.<\/i><\/strong> Made with the help of a passionate group of internet forum collaborators, the game was released for free on the web in 2006, and later followed up by <i>Knytt Stories<\/i> (2007) and <i>Knytt Underground<\/i> (2012). <i>IGN<\/i> called <i>Knytt<\/i> &quot;an extremely soothing and memorable ambient adventure&quot;, while <i>Edge Magazine<\/i> remarked it was &quot;pure platforming pleasure and a wonderfully soothing soundscape.&quot;<i> <\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help celebrate the 20th anniversary, <strong>Bit Kid<\/strong> (<i>Chasm<\/i>, <i>WOLFHOUND<\/i>) is proud to present <i><strong>Knytt Classic<\/strong><\/i>, a free pixel-perfect port with full controller support, achievements, bonus modes, display effects, and much more!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/ecd76e78522d714b34856632e0b056c8.poster.avif?t=1794515289\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/ecd76e78522d714b34856632e0b056c8.webm?t=1794515289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/ecd76e78522d714b34856632e0b056c8.mp4?t=1794515289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the Knytt, a peaceful being who is abducted by aliens for a cruise across the solar system and ends up crash-landing on another world. Explore the atmospheric, maze-like planet and collect all the parts from your crashed ship in order to return home. As <i>Edge<\/i> put it, &quot;There’s no combat, no switches, and no real puzzles to speak of, just plentiful checkpoints, pure platforming pleasure and a wonderfully soothing soundscape.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/46e0a11739a30a921ce0c7302459a5c3.poster.avif?t=1794515289\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/46e0a11739a30a921ce0c7302459a5c3.webm?t=1794515289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/46e0a11739a30a921ce0c7302459a5c3.mp4?t=1794515289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pixel-perfect port of Nifflas' indie freeware classic <i>Knytt<\/i> (2006)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1,500 screens to explore across the original game and three bonus modes<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus Modes include <i><strong>UltraTough<\/strong>, <\/i>a brand new challenging mode by Bit Kid, <strong>Hempuli<\/strong>’s (<i>Baba Is You, Environment Station Alpha<\/i>) mod <strong>Knytt XH (<i>Extra Hard)<\/i><\/strong>, and <strong><i>Brutally Unfair Knytt<\/i><\/strong>’s remixed world<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements &amp; hidden bonuses<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full gamepad support and remappable controls<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple aspect ratios &amp; display effects, including retro CRT and handheld LCD styles<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional in-game timer and fastest completion time tracking<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows, Mac, Linux &amp; Steam Deck support<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/6e3cc0d21b8cba1d34b3bd400e86596a.poster.avif?t=1794515289\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/6e3cc0d21b8cba1d34b3bd400e86596a.webm?t=1794515289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/extras\/6e3cc0d21b8cba1d34b3bd400e86596a.mp4?t=1794515289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Celebrate the 20th anniversary of the indie freeware classic, rebuilt for modern machines! Explore a maze-like planet as the Knytt, a peaceful being abducted by aliens, find your missing ship parts, and get back home in this zen-like atmospheric platformer.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","reviews":"“A sprawling 2D wonderland of subtly animated backdrops and curiously charismatic creatures”<br \/>\r\nEdge Magazine<br \/>\r\n<br \/>\r\n“The video game equivalent of curling up and unwinding with a nice, relaxing book”<br \/>\r\nIGN<br \/>\r\n<br \/>\r\n“Relaxed, low-key adventure that’s a great change of pace from the usual adrenaline rush”<br \/>\r\nHardcore Gamer Magazine<br \/>\r\n","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2656050\/a28f2f963012d2b39d